### Match engine — instant results, and the interactive live session (Faza 3).
###
### The live session key is: competitionId_season_round_teamId1_teamId2
### The variables below build one; edit them, or override per request.

@teamId1 = 1
@teamId2 = 2
@matchKey = {{competitionId}}_{{season}}_{{round}}_{{teamId1}}_{{teamId2}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Already-played match — the read-only views

### Full timeline of events
# @name matchEvents
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/matchEvents/{{competitionId}}/{{season}}/{{round}}/{{teamId1}}/{{teamId2}}

### Result + narrative summary
# @name matchSummary
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/summary/{{competitionId}}/{{season}}/{{round}}/{{teamId1}}/{{teamId2}}

### Per-player ratings — check these when the rating formula is being tuned
# @name playerRatings
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/playerRatings/{{competitionId}}/{{season}}/{{round}}/{{teamId1}}/{{teamId2}}

### The full stat block: possession, shots, xG, duels, passing
# @name matchStats
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/stats/{{competitionId}}/{{season}}/{{round}}/{{teamId1}}/{{teamId2}}

### Season totals for a team
# @name seasonStats
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/stats/season/{{teamId}}/{{season}}

### Head to head
# @name h2h
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/h2h/{{teamId1}}/{{teamId2}}

### Fixture list for a team
# @name calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/calendar/{{teamId}}/{{season}}

### Pre-match preview
# @name preview
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/preview/{{teamId}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Live simulation timeline (pre-baked, non-interactive)

### By key
# @name liveByKey
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/live/{{matchKey}}

### By parameters
# @name liveByParams
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/live/{{competitionId}}/{{season}}/{{round}}/{{teamId1}}/{{teamId2}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Interactive live session.
### Order: state -> advance (repeatedly) -> substitute -> advance to 90 -> commit.
### 404 means the session was never created or the cache evicted it; open the
### match from the frontend first, or advance a day so the matchday creates one.

### Current minute, score, pitch + bench with stamina, subs remaining
# @name liveState
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/live/{{matchKey}}/state

### Tick the simulation forward. Call repeatedly with a rising minute.
# @name liveAdvance
POST {{baseUrl}}/match/live/{{matchKey}}/advance?untilMinute=45
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Manager substitution. Both players must belong to your team.
### atMinute is optional — 0 means "record at the current minute".
# @name liveSubstitute
POST {{baseUrl}}/match/live/{{matchKey}}/substitute
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "playerOutId": 1,
  "playerInId": 12,
  "atMinute": 0
}

### Run to full time
# @name liveAdvanceFullTime
POST {{baseUrl}}/match/live/{{matchKey}}/advance?untilMinute=90
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Finalize: standings, scorers, injuries, suspensions, press conference.
### Idempotent — a second call returns alreadyCommitted:true.
# @name liveCommit
POST {{baseUrl}}/match/live/{{matchKey}}/commit
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Animation engine (V3)

### @name animationPreview
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/animation/preview

### @name animationLivePreview
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/animation/livePreview

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Player-level checks

### @name playerCard
GET {{baseUrl}}/humans/{{playerId}}/card

### @name playerForm
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/playerForm/{{playerId}}

### @name comparePlayers
GET {{baseUrl}}/humans/compare/1/2
